Marshall is going to understand the game and Marshall and Marshall alone will understand it because of something we set up in season one It's very cool how things come together like that, right?
马歇尔会理解这个游戏，而且只有马歇尔一个人会懂，因为我们在第一季里做过铺垫。事情能像这样串联起来真的很酷，对吧？

00:37:27.059 --> 00:37:29.840
And it's and then what are Ted and Robin going to be doing?
而且——然后泰德和罗宾要干什么呢？

