They're just they're a couple They can't have a couple problem the whole episodes about Marshall and Lily's couplehood What's the stupidest thing we could have for them?
他们只是一对情侣。整集都在讲马歇尔和莉莉的伴侣关系，他们俩总不能也遇到情侣问题吧？

