It just makes them fun And I like to think we really nailed it It's really one of my favorite parts of the whole episode They literally go have sex in like an Atlantic City municipal buildings broom closet because ramen's wearing a shirt that has nice boobies on it.
我们能为他们安排什么最蠢的事情呢？

00:37:50.340 --> 00:37:52.139
It's absolutely absurd.
这只会让他们变得很有趣。我愿意认为我们真的把这部分做得很绝。这绝对是我整集中最喜欢的部分之一。他们竟然在大西洋城市政厅的杂物间里做爱，因为罗宾穿了一件胸部看起来很棒的衬衫。

